From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:45:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] design: 6px buttons with semibold labels, emerald accent in
 the dark theme

Chosen on full screens of the landing page, the cloud and Light: pill
buttons gave way to a 6px corner, and Light's green stays in the light
theme while the dark theme takes a livelier emerald.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tKeE4iJ874reAvf4rR
